  "solution": {
    "text": "The number of moles of Fe taken <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>112</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> <br/><br/>So the chemical reaction is<br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>New work done  <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>Since  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Hence volume of solids and liquids is taken as  <math><mo>≅</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>So work done  <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>also  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>  or  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>So work done  <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>         [ <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  Cal]<br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1200</mn></math>  Cal.",
